title: 'goal : maximum orthogonality, minimum switching cost'
pid: 67cb3d1d-a8b5-4b3b-a233-c50a21e38f34
body: |2-
  Nobody should need to know much of what anyone else knows.
  But if we specialized so deeply that each task needed to be signed off on
  by a big committee, that would slow us down too.
